<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1320755350"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:17.597"><div begin="43.400" end="1:08.465" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.400" end="49.457" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.400" end="46.965">海浪无声将夜幕深</span><span begin="46.965" end="47.926">深</span><span begin="48.197" end="49.457">淹没</span></p><p begin="50.357" end="55.388" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.357" end="53.411">漫过天空尽头的</span><span begin="53.708" end="55.388">角落</span></p><p begin="57.106" end="1:02.987" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.106" end="1:00.614">大鱼在梦境的缝隙</span><span begin="1:00.614" end="1:01.846">里</span><span begin="1:01.846" end="1:02.987">游过</span></p><p begin="1:04.019" end="1:08.465" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.019" end="1:04.965">凝望</span><span begin="1:04.965" end="1:05.454">你</span><span begin="1:05.590" end="1:07.601">沉睡的轮</span><span begin="1:07.601" end="1:08.465">廓</span></p></div><div begin="1:09.928" end="1:35.651" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:09.928" end="1:13.114" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.928" end="1:10.803">看海</span><span begin="1:10.803" end="1:12.100">天</span><span begin="1:12.100" end="1:13.114">一色</span></p><p begin="1:13.358" end="1:16.574" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.358" end="1:14.166">听风</span><span begin="1:14.166" end="1:15.582">起</span><span begin="1:15.582" end="1:16.574">雨落</span></p><p begin="1:16.748" end="1:22.708" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.748" end="1:17.616">执子</span><span begin="1:17.616" end="1:18.460">手</span><span begin="1:18.460" end="1:20.817">吹散苍茫茫</span><span begin="1:21.168" end="1:22.708">烟波</span></p><p begin="1:23.685" end="1:26.745" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.685" end="1:24.579">大鱼</span><span begin="1:24.579" end="1:25.855">的</span><span begin="1:25.855" end="1:26.149">翅</span><span begin="1:26.149" end="1:26.745">膀</span></p><p begin="1:27.128" end="1:31.028" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.128" end="1:27.929">已经</span><span begin="1:27.929" end="1:29.665">太辽</span><span begin="1:29.665" end="1:31.028">阔</span></p><p begin="1:31.382" end="1:35.651" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.382" end="1:32.762">我松开</span><span begin="1:33.032" end="1:34.890">时间的绳</span><span begin="1:34.890" end="1:35.651">索</span></p></div><div begin="1:37.347" end="2:03.782" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:37.347" end="1:40.617" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.347" end="1:38.209">怕你</span><span begin="1:38.209" end="1:39.631">飞</span><span begin="1:39.631" end="1:40.617">远去</span></p><p begin="1:40.883" end="1:43.892" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.883" end="1:41.786">怕你</span><span begin="1:41.786" end="1:42.592">离</span><span begin="1:42.592" end="1:43.892">我而去</span></p><p begin="1:44.237" end="1:49.688" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.237" end="1:45.736">更怕你</span><span begin="1:45.942" end="1:48.715">永远停留在这</span><span begin="1:48.715" end="1:49.688">里</span></p><p begin="1:51.015" end="1:54.316" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.015" end="1:51.989">每一</span><span begin="1:51.989" end="1:53.335">滴</span><span begin="1:53.335" end="1:54.316">泪水</span></p><p begin="1:54.566" end="1:58.158" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.566" end="1:55.449">都向</span><span begin="1:55.449" end="1:56.237">你</span><span begin="1:56.237" end="1:57.059">流淌</span><span begin="1:57.059" end="1:58.158">去</span></p><p begin="1:58.850" end="2:03.782" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.850" end="2:00.424">倒流进</span><span begin="2:00.502" end="2:02.521">天空的海</span><span begin="2:02.521" end="2:03.782">底</span></p></div><div begin="2:19.386" end="2:44.344" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:19.386" end="2:25.367" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.386" end="2:22.833">海浪无声将夜幕深</span><span begin="2:22.8